# Stimulsoft print design

Taken from the edited `ProductionOrderForm` template (ReportBuilder report 39). New print forms use the same text rules.

## Font

- Persian labels, values, titles, and grid headers: `IRANSansWeb(FaNum) Medium` (FaNum so digits stay Persian).
- Do not use Tahoma for those texts. Do not set Bold on body values.
- Title of the form: same family, size 18, center.
- Grid column headers: size 7, center.
- Header number and date values: size 10, color maroon `128,0,0`. Their labels: size 9.

## Direction

- Page `RightToLeft = true`.
- Persian text (labels and Persian names): `TextOptions.RightToLeft = true`.
- Codes, dates, quantities, and the row number: `RightToLeft = false` so the digits are not reversed. Same for the order number and the header date.
- Grid cells (headers and item values): horizontal alignment Center.

## Example

```text
Font: IRANSansWeb(FaNum) Medium
عنوان / نام مشتری     RightToLeft true
کد تجهیز / تاریخ / تعداد / شماره ردیف     RightToLeft false, Center
شماره و تاریخ سربرگ     size 10, maroon, RightToLeft false
```
